---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import logo from "../assets/logo_transparente_v2.png";

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-primary text-white pt-24 pb-12 overflow-hidden relative">
    {/* Decorative wave */}
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 -translate-y-full">
        <svg
            viewBox="0 0 1440 120"
            fill="none"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            class="w-full h-auto rotate-180 translate-y-[2px]"
        >
            <path
                d="M0 120V60C240 20 480 0 720 0C960 0 1200 20 1440 60V120H0Z"
                fill="hsl(var(--primary))"></path>
        </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-20">
            <div class="col-span-1 lg:col-span-2">
                <a
                    href="#inicio"
                    class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 block group"
                >
                    <Image
                        src={logo}
                        alt="Logotipo oficial Tatiane Miranda Psicologia Clínica"
                        class="w-auto h-14 md:h-16 brightness-0 invert"
                    />
                    <div>
                        <span
                            class="block font-heading text-2xl text-white leading-none"
                            >Tatiane Miranda</span
                        >
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-1">
                            <span
                                class="text-xs font-body text-white/60 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase"
                                >Psicóloga Clínica</span
                            >
                            <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/20"
                            ></span>
                            <span
                                class="text-xs font-body text-white/40 uppercase tracking-widest"
                                >CRP 05/73753</span
                            >
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </a>
                <p
                    class="font-body text-white/70 max-w-sm mb-8 leading-relaxed"
                >
                    Oferecendo um espaço ético e acolhedor para o cuidado da
                    saúde mental através do atendimento clínico humanizado.
                </p>
                <div class="flex gap-4">
                    <a
                        href="#"
                        class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-white hover:text-primary transition-all duration-300"
                    >
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            width="20"
                            height="20"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            ><rect
                                width="20"
                                height="20"
                                x="2"
                                y="2"
                                rx="5"
                                ry="5"></rect><path
                                d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"
                            ></path><line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5"
                            ></line></svg
                        >
                    </a>
                    <a
                        href="#"
                        class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-white hover:text-primary transition-all duration-300"
                    >
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            width="20"
                            height="20"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            ><path
                                d="M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z"
                            ></path></svg
                        >
                    </a>
                    <a
                        href="#"
                        class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-white hover:text-primary transition-all duration-300"
                    >
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            width="20"
                            height="20"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            ><rect
                                width="20"
                                height="20"
                                x="2"
                                y="2"
                                rx="5"
                                ry="5"></rect><path
                                d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"
                            ></path><line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5"
                            ></line></svg
                        >
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div>
                <h4 class="font-heading text-xl mb-6">Navegação</h4>
                <ul class="space-y-4 font-body text-white/70">
                    <li>
                        <a
                            href="#inicio"
                            class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Início</a
                        >
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a
                            href="#sobre"
                            class="hover:text-white transition-colors"
                            >Sobre mim</a
                        >
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a
                            href="#especialidades"
                            class="hover:text-white transition-colors"
                            >Especialidades</a
                        >
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a
                            href="#como-funciona"
                            class="hover:text-white transition-colors"
                            >Como funciona</a
                        >
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a
                            href="#faq"
                            class="hover:text-white transition-colors">FAQ</a
                        >
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div>
                <h4 class="font-heading text-xl mb-6">Contato</h4>
                <ul class="space-y-4 font-body text-white/70">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            width="18"
                            height="18"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            ><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"
                            ></rect><path
                                d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"
                            ></path></svg
                        >
                        contato@tatianemiranda.com.br
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            width="18"
                            height="18"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            ><path
                                d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"
                            ></path></svg
                        >
                        (21) 99906-4502
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            width="18"
                            height="18"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            class="mt-1"
                            ><path
                                d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"
                            ></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg
                        >
                        <span
                            >Atendimento Online para todo o Brasil & Presencial
                            em [Endereço]</span
                        >
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div
            class="pt-8 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6"
        >
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-white/50">
                © {year} Tatiane Miranda — Psicóloga Clínica. Todos os direitos reservados.
            </p>
            <div
                class="flex items-center gap-2 text-white/50 text-xs font-body tracking-wider"
            >
                <span>Desenvolvido por</span>
                <a
                    href="https://www.sitesalphacode.com.br"
                    target="_blank"
                    class="text-white hover:underline transition-all font-bold"
                    >ALPHA CODE</a
                >
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
